    {
      "id": "rc_balance_sweep_not_deltas",
      "kind": "root_cause",
      "text": "The CL fee claim calls clPool.collectFees(), ignores the returned amounts, and forwards the gauge's raw token0/token1 balanceOf balances to the internal bribe via notifyRewardAmount instead of fee deltas.",
